source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Braced_(Condition)\" title=\"Braced (Condition)\">Braced</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>On damage rolls, roll twice and use the higher result.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by wielding the following weapon types with <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">proficiency</a>:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heavy_Crossbows\" title=\"Heavy Crossbows\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Heavy_Crossbows_Icon.png/25px-Heavy_Crossbows_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Heavy_Crossbows_Icon.png/38px-Heavy_Crossbows_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Heavy_Crossbows_Icon.png/50px-Heavy_Crossbows_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heavy Crossbows\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Heavy_Crossbows_Icon.png/25px-Heavy_Crossbows_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/16/Heavy_Crossbows_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heavy_Crossbows\" title=\"Heavy Crossbows\">Heavy Crossbows</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Longbows\" title=\"Longbows\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Longbows_Icon.png/25px-Longbows_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Longbows_Icon.png/38px-Longbows_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Longbows_Icon.png/50px-Longbows_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Longbows\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Longbows_Icon.png/25px-Longbows_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Longbows_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Longbows\" title=\"Longbows\">Longbows</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Brace breaks <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hiding_(Condition)\" title=\"Hiding (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hiding\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hiding_(Condition)\" title=\"Hiding (Condition)\">Hiding</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><